    "answer": {
      "short": "2880 ball bearings.",
      "worked": "The length scale factor is $2$, so the volume scale factor is $2^3=8$.\n\n$$\\begin{aligned}\\text{Number of ball bearings}&=360\\times2^3\\\\&=2880\\end{aligned}$$",
      "solutionDiagrams": []
    },
